    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "1SA 21:1",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then David came to Nob to Ahimelech the priest. Ahimelech came to meet David trembling, and said to him, “Why are you alone, and no man with you?”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 21:2",
        "textualBasisJa": "David said to Ahimelech the priest, “The king has commanded me to do something, and has said to me, ‘Let no one know anything about the business about which I send you, and what I have commanded you. I have sent the young men to a certain place.’"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 21:8",
        "textualBasisJa": "David said to Ahimelech, “Isn’t there here under your hand spear or sword? For I haven’t brought my sword or my weapons with me, because the king’s business required haste.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 22:9",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then Doeg the Edomite, who stood by the servants of Saul, answered and said, “I saw the son of Jesse coming to Nob, to Ahimelech the son of Ahitub."
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 22:11",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then the king sent to call Ahimelech the priest, the son of Ahitub, and all his father’s house, the priests who were in Nob; and they all came to the king."
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 22:14",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then Ahimelech answered the king, and said, “Who among all your servants is so faithful as David, who is the king’s son-in-law, captain of your body guard, and honored in your house?"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 22:16",
        "textualBasisJa": "The king said, “You shall surely die, Ahimelech, you and all your father’s house.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 22:20",
        "textualBasisJa": "One of the sons of Ahimelech the son of Ahitub, named Abiathar, escaped and fled after David."
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 23:6",
        "textualBasisJa": "When Abiathar the son of Ahimelech fled to David to Keilah, he came down with an ephod in his hand."
      },
      {
        "ref": "1SA 30:7",
        "textualBasisJa": "David said to Abiathar the priest, the son of Ahimelech, “Please bring the ephod here to me.” Abiathar brought the ephod to David."
      }
    ],
